  "answer": "2026 年诺贝尔化学奖于 2026 年 10 月 7 日公布，两位获奖者是：\n\n1. **亨利·卡冈（Henri B. Kagan）**，法国巴黎南大学（奥赛）\n2. **硖合宪三（Kenso Soai）**，日本东京理科大学\n\n获奖理由是他们发现了不对称有机合成中的非线性效应和自催化。两人平分奖金。\n\n搜索摘要里写着 Soai 95 岁，这一点看起来不对：95 岁左右的应该是 1930 年出生的 Kagan。不过这个细节和问题无关，我没有再查。\n\n本次只搜索了 1 次。\n\n依据：\n- [Nobel Prize in Chemistry 2026 – nobelprize.org](https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/chemistry/2026/)\n- [Nobel Prize in Chemistry 2026 summary – nobelprize.org](https://nobelprize.org/prizes/chemistry/2026/summary)\n- [Henri Kagan and Kenso Soai win 2026 Nobel Prize in chemistry – Ynetnews](https://www.ynetnews.com/health_science/article/bk2wuc7smx)\n- [Kagan and Soai win 2026 Nobel chemistry prize – ThePrint](https://theprint.in/world/kagan-and-soai-win-2026-nobel-chemistry-prize/3064245/)\n- [UNB](https://unb.com.bd/category/World/henri-b-kagan-kenso-soai-awarded-nobel-prize-in-chemistry/197240)",
